What is the output of the following Java program using a bare return statement for input validation in a constructor?
```java
public class GuardedConfig {
    int threshold = 10;
    public GuardedConfig(int value) {
        if (value < 0) {
            return;
        }
        this.threshold = value;
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        GuardedConfig cfg = new GuardedConfig(-5);
        System.out.println("Threshold:" + cfg.threshold);
    }
}
```

